  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Monitoring and Evaluation through PCU up to 15/16 (M&amp;E costs for 16/17 included within PCU costs -103; and included in -115 from 17/18 onwards) is a component of IMPACT -  Investment to fund innovative solutions for development and help develop sustainable investment markets reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;1,303,036. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Financial policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
